"What is the linear transformation $T$ whose standard matrix is $T=[\\begin{aligned}2 & -1 & 4 \\\\ 5 & 3 & -2 \\\\ 1 & -6 & 7\\end{aligned}]?$\n\n| $T:[\\begin{aligned}x \\\\ y \\\\ z\\end{aligned}]⟶\\,\\,$ |  | {{field-1}} |  |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n|  | {{field-2}} |  |  |\n|  | {{field-3}} |  |  |" :question/worked-solution "Consider a general vector $\\,[\\begin{aligned}x \\\\ y \\\\ z\\end{aligned}].$ Multiplying by the matrix $T,$ we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}T\\cdot [\\begin{aligned}x \\\\ y \\\\ z\\end{aligned}] & =[\\begin{aligned}2 & -1 & 4 \\\\ 5 & 3 & -2 \\\\ 1 & -6 & 7\\end{aligned}]\\cdot [\\begin{aligned}x \\\\ y \\\\ z\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}2x-y+4z \\\\ 5x+3y-2z \\\\ x-6y+7z\\end{aligned}].\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the linear transformation $\\,T\\,$ is given by\n\n$$\nT:[\\begin{aligned}x \\\\ y \\\\ z\\end{aligned}]⟶[\\begin{aligned}2x-y+4z \\\\ 5x+3y-2z \\\\ x-6y+7z\\end{aligned}].\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-317044/field-1" "q-317044/field-2" "q-317044/field-3"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "656da168-af12-53c2-8add-2c82cf71b31c"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-317044"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-317057/field-1/4de395131b8c6206950603752bf3404c42f4dd6f0a41fee38e42388d1b92c133" :answer/id #uuid "674d480d-cc3a-59d2-9586-605874f79fcd" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-5" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-317057/field-1" :answer-field/id #uuid "63cfcd97-f006-5cbd-8df9-101f0a1f52ff" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/correct "q-317057/field-1/4de395131b8c6206950603752bf3404c42f4dd6f0a41fee38e42388d1b92c133" :answer-field/choices ["q-317057/field-1/4de395131b8c6206950603752bf3404c42f4dd6f0a41fee38e42388d1b92c133"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-317057/field-2/a0e0e68f25b8b46aafef3b74aff7beff7fddc6de5bf36921680b04c7b